Exercise demonstration frames used in RANK UP (index.html).

  Artwork:  Workout Guide by Bryl Lim — https://bryllim.com
  Based on: Everkinetic — https://github.com/everkinetic/data
  Licence:  CC BY-SA 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Three frames per movement, 512x512 transparent SVG, taken unmodified from
github.com/bryllim/workout-guide. The app tints them with a CSS filter at
display time; the files themselves are byte-identical to upstream.

120 movement sets are included here, covering 126 of the app's 155 movements.
The remaining 29 have no art and fall back to the muscle map, because a
demonstration of the wrong movement is worse than no demonstration.

CC BY-SA 4.0 requires attribution and ShareAlike on the artwork and on any
adaptation of it. The credit is shown in the app under Status, and the full
licence text is in LICENSE beside this file. Per-frame upstream sources are in
ATTRIBUTION-upstream.md.

The muscle map figures are a separate work under a separate licence; see
art/body/NOTICE.
